      ('ltc-careers-005', 'Independence is something most of us take for granted until we start losing it. As you think about your own life after high school, what would it look like to help someone else hold on to theirs, and would that kind of work appeal to you?'),
      ('ltc-careers-006', 'It is easy to overlook the jobs that keep places safe and livable. As you imagine your future workplace, what would it mean to take pride in work that is mostly invisible until it stops happening?'),
