      ('ltc-careers-008', 'Art and health care do not always feel like they belong in the same conversation. As you think about what you are good at, what would it look like to use a creative skill of yours in a job that helps someone else?'),
      ('ltc-careers-009', 'Trust is usually built in small, repeated moments, not in big ones. As you imagine your own first job after high school, where would you want to be the person who shows up consistently enough to actually be trusted?'),
      ('ltc-careers-010', 'Not every health care career starts with years of school. As you think about your own pace, would you rather find a hands-on entry point quickly and grow from there, or take a longer route through more training first?'),
