      ('ltc-careers-012', 'Careers do not have to stay flat. As you think about your own future five or ten years out, do you imagine yourself going deeper into one specialty, moving into leadership, or staying close to the people you started serving?'),
      ('ltc-careers-013', 'Big places only work because someone is balancing a lot of competing needs at once. As you picture your own working life, would you rather be the one delivering the care directly, or the one keeping the whole place running?'),
      ('ltc-careers-014', 'Some careers reward people who like complexity. As you think about what kind of problems you want to spend years getting good at, would you rather work on questions with clean answers or on questions where the answer keeps shifting?'),
